2026-07-23T09:53:42.375-05:00	feedback	row=0006	actual_labels.jsonl	reviewer_note	Overall the test cases satisfy the requirement functionality. However, it remains unclear in the requirement what is meant by "all other roles". These roles should be referenced or listed here to ensure that all the "other roles" are denied as stated in the requirement. Additionally, it needs to be clarified whether any higher access roles (such as system admin) would be able to access the note data and if whether this is intended should be clarified in the requirement. Consider this revision to the requirement to ensure that all roles or role groups are tested.	by=dsobc
